==Description==
The '''Giftbearer Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 32 of the premium [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|1,125}} or {{Robux|94}} ({{Robux|75}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|16,335}} or {{Robux|3,331}} ({{Robux|2,652}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

The '''Giftbearer Nametag''' has white text with a translucent gradient, which colors are split between shaded yellow and orange. It also emits red and yellow smoke, yellow fireworks and strings with ornaments around the nametag.

